WEBVTT

00:00:08.356 --> 00:00:09.691
Mavis?

00:00:09.774 --> 00:00:13.445
This is gonna be the coolest surprise
when you see the surprise!

00:00:13.528 --> 00:00:15.155
(whoops, laughs)

00:00:15.238 --> 00:00:17.657
H-Hey! Tinkles!

00:00:17.741 --> 00:00:19.242
Hey, Dennis. Hey, Winnie.

00:00:19.326 --> 00:00:21.745
Dad? Is that you?

00:00:21.828 --> 00:00:23.079
Yeah! Isn't it great?

00:00:23.163 --> 00:00:25.248
I got to go show your mom. (laughs)

00:00:28.168 --> 00:00:29.169
(gasps)

00:00:30.462 --> 00:00:32.464
Papa Drac, is that my dad?

00:00:32.547 --> 00:00:34.507
(stammering)

00:00:34.591 --> 00:00:36.676
(spooky voice):
That was not your father,

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.803
just some random monster.

00:00:38.887 --> 00:00:41.056
Everything is normal.

00:00:41.139 --> 00:00:44.434
BOTH (monotone):
Everything is normal.

00:00:44.517 --> 00:00:47.979
Mavis? Where are you?

00:00:48.063 --> 00:00:49.230
(gasps)

00:00:50.231 --> 00:00:51.650
The party!

00:00:54.694 --> 00:00:57.614
Mavis, I've got the best news ever!

00:00:57.697 --> 00:00:59.199
Whoa-oh!

00:00:59.282 --> 00:01:00.283
(grunting)

00:01:01.368 --> 00:01:02.786
(elevator bell dings)

00:01:04.913 --> 00:01:06.373
(grunts)

00:01:07.916 --> 00:01:10.001
(panting)

00:01:15.674 --> 00:01:17.467
(elevator bell dings)

00:01:20.303 --> 00:01:21.346
Oh, no.

00:01:21.429 --> 00:01:23.348
(screaming)

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:26.476
Drac?

00:01:27.686 --> 00:01:29.062
(grunting)

00:01:30.605 --> 00:01:31.982
(whimpering)

00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:35.610
(screaming)

00:01:35.694 --> 00:01:37.112
Oh, no!

00:01:37.195 --> 00:01:38.530
Something's wrong!

00:01:38.613 --> 00:01:39.864
Don't worry! (grunts)

00:01:39.948 --> 00:01:42.325
I got you, Drac!

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:44.369
(chewing noisily)

00:01:44.452 --> 00:01:45.954
GRIFFIN:
Hey, Frank, relax.

00:01:46.037 --> 00:01:47.372
It's not a contest.

00:01:47.455 --> 00:01:49.666
(Dracula screaming)

00:01:49.749 --> 00:01:50.875
-Huh?
-Huh?

00:01:50.959 --> 00:01:52.836
(Johnny screaming)

00:01:55.672 --> 00:01:56.756
(panting)

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:57.841
Drac?

00:01:59.843 --> 00:02:00.844
Hey, guys.

00:02:00.927 --> 00:02:02.137
ALL:
Johnny?

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:03.221
Is that you?!

00:02:03.304 --> 00:02:04.764
Yeah, it's me.

00:02:04.848 --> 00:02:06.099
Pretty great, right?

00:02:06.182 --> 00:02:08.309
-Whoa. -What's going on?
-What happened to you?

00:02:08.393 --> 00:02:09.602
GRIFFIN:
Wait, where's Drac?

00:02:09.686 --> 00:02:10.729
DRACULA:
Help!

00:02:10.812 --> 00:02:12.480
(screams)

00:02:12.564 --> 00:02:13.565
Drac?

00:02:13.648 --> 00:02:14.858
Hey, come on down here!

00:02:14.941 --> 00:02:16.192
Did you see Johnny?

00:02:16.276 --> 00:02:17.402
He's a monster!

00:02:17.485 --> 00:02:18.611
DRACULA:
I know!

00:02:18.695 --> 00:02:20.739
I can't fly!

00:02:20.822 --> 00:02:23.366
Did he just say "Wow, that's a fly"?

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:25.827
GRIFFIN: No, he definitely
said something about pie.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:27.871
Stop fooling around and come down here!

00:02:27.954 --> 00:02:29.706
I'm not fooling around!

00:02:29.789 --> 00:02:30.874
I... (shouts)

00:02:30.957 --> 00:02:32.917
(screaming)

00:02:35.211 --> 00:02:39.174
Uh, guys, he's not turning into a bat.

00:02:39.257 --> 00:02:40.800
Don't worry. I got him.

00:02:42.969 --> 00:02:44.637
-Whoa.
-Hey.

00:02:44.721 --> 00:02:46.890
(panting)

00:02:47.932 --> 00:02:49.601
(groaning)

00:02:49.684 --> 00:02:51.603
(grunting)

00:02:51.686 --> 00:02:52.896
(all gasp)

00:02:57.817 --> 00:02:58.818
(all gasp)

00:02:58.902 --> 00:02:59.903
Drac?

00:02:59.986 --> 00:03:01.738
Y-You-you look, uh, uh...

00:03:01.821 --> 00:03:03.490
You look terrible.

00:03:03.573 --> 00:03:05.450
(gasps) Oh, no.

00:03:05.533 --> 00:03:06.576
Oh, no, no, no.

00:03:06.659 --> 00:03:08.203
Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:03:08.286 --> 00:03:09.454
No!

00:03:09.537 --> 00:03:11.331
It can't be.

00:03:11.414 --> 00:03:13.416
(whimpering)

00:03:16.669 --> 00:03:17.962
(sobs)

00:03:18.046 --> 00:03:20.215
Wow, look at us, Drac.

00:03:20.298 --> 00:03:23.051
You're human and I'm a monster.

00:03:23.134 --> 00:03:26.262
It's like Freaky Friday
but on a Tuesday, though.

00:03:26.346 --> 00:03:28.306
(screaming)

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:31.059
Where is it? Where is it?

00:03:31.142 --> 00:03:32.644
It's got to be here somewhere.

00:03:32.727 --> 00:03:34.479
What is going on, Drac?

00:03:34.562 --> 00:03:36.731
I need to find the ray!

00:03:36.815 --> 00:03:38.274
You mean that one right there?

00:03:38.358 --> 00:03:40.026
-(moans)
-Ooh-hoo-hoo!

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.152
(grunting)

00:03:41.236 --> 00:03:43.029
Come on. Come on!

00:03:43.113 --> 00:03:44.823
Why isn't this working? Come on!

00:03:44.906 --> 00:03:46.658
I think it might be broken.

00:03:46.741 --> 00:03:48.201
(sobs):
No!

00:03:48.284 --> 00:03:49.327
It can't be.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:50.787
Hey, have you seen my dad?

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.122
(shouts)

00:03:52.205 --> 00:03:53.248
Come on, Johnny. (grunts)

00:03:53.331 --> 00:03:54.457
We're getting out of here.

00:03:54.541 --> 00:03:55.750
-What? No way.
-(straining)

00:03:55.834 --> 00:03:58.378
I got to tell Mavis
that her dream is back on.

00:03:58.461 --> 00:04:00.296
You know, now that I'm a monster and all.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.381
No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:04:01.464 --> 00:04:03.424
(spooky voice):
You will obey me.

00:04:03.508 --> 00:04:06.219
You will come with me!

00:04:08.596 --> 00:04:10.515
Hey, Mavis, I got great news!

00:04:10.598 --> 00:04:12.517
(grunting nervously)

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:13.893
(screams)

00:04:13.977 --> 00:04:15.145
Johnny.

00:04:15.228 --> 00:04:17.272
(grunting dramatically)

00:04:17.355 --> 00:04:18.481
Huh?

00:04:18.565 --> 00:04:20.108
Hey, Drac, what's wrong?

00:04:20.191 --> 00:04:22.402
Oh, it is the humanness!

00:04:22.485 --> 00:04:23.611
(grunting dramatically)

00:04:23.695 --> 00:04:25.029
Drac! Oh, my gosh!

00:04:25.113 --> 00:04:26.364
Wh-What do we do?

00:04:26.447 --> 00:04:29.367
Quick, take me to Van Helsing!

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:30.702
(grunting dramatically)

00:04:30.785 --> 00:04:32.412
Oh, okay. I got you, Drac.

00:04:32.495 --> 00:04:34.831
Do not tell Mavis!

00:04:34.914 --> 00:04:36.541
Ooh! Ow-wee! The lab!

00:04:36.624 --> 00:04:41.045
Hurry! I can feel my insides melting away!

00:04:42.297 --> 00:04:44.799
Uh... wh-what just happened?

00:04:44.883 --> 00:04:45.884
-MAVIS: Hey.
-(all gasp)

00:04:45.967 --> 00:04:46.885
Was that my dad?

00:04:46.968 --> 00:04:48.428
No. What? Uh, no.

00:04:48.511 --> 00:04:49.679
-Absolutely not.
-Nope.

00:04:49.762 --> 00:04:51.556
GRIFFIN: Are you doing
something different with your hair?

00:04:51.639 --> 00:04:54.267
Um, what is going on?

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:55.894
What's going on?

00:04:55.977 --> 00:05:00.481
Um, Wayne here was about to
show off some new dance moves.

00:05:00.565 --> 00:05:02.442
-Dance moves?
-Yeah, go get 'em.

00:05:02.525 --> 00:05:03.526
-Whoa.
-Go get 'em.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.528
Uh, um...

00:05:05.612 --> 00:05:07.030
(grunting softly)

00:05:09.699 --> 00:05:10.909
(chuckles):
Yeah.

00:05:10.992 --> 00:05:12.994
(grunting rhythmically)

00:05:14.662 --> 00:05:15.788
Oh.

00:05:15.872 --> 00:05:17.749
Huh?

00:05:17.832 --> 00:05:18.958
Okay.

00:05:19.042 --> 00:05:20.835
Uh, well, if you see my dad,

00:05:20.919 --> 00:05:22.754
please tell him I need to talk to him.

00:05:22.837 --> 00:05:25.256
(Wayne continues grunting rhythmically)

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:26.507
Oh, yeah.

00:05:26.591 --> 00:05:27.592
(laughs)

00:05:27.675 --> 00:05:28.843
Watch me now. Yeah.

00:05:28.927 --> 00:05:30.803
(screams, grunts)

00:05:30.887 --> 00:05:32.263
Ow.

00:05:32.347 --> 00:05:34.224
♪ ♪

00:05:34.307 --> 00:05:35.892
Well, it's broken.

00:05:35.975 --> 00:05:38.811
The crystal's cracked,
and it's beyond repair.

00:05:38.895 --> 00:05:40.688
Wait, what?! (grunts)

00:05:40.772 --> 00:05:42.315
Then get a new one!

00:05:42.398 --> 00:05:44.776
Whoa. Someone's feeling better.

00:05:44.859 --> 00:05:48.738
These crystals are very rare
and hard to come by.

00:05:48.821 --> 00:05:52.325
It took me three years to find that one.

00:05:52.408 --> 00:05:55.578
You see, I was a young
monster hunter at the time--

00:05:55.662 --> 00:05:57.705
well, not too young, but I felt young.

00:05:57.789 --> 00:05:59.874
Okay, don't need the whole story.

00:05:59.958 --> 00:06:03.628
Well, luckily for you,
I was brilliant enough to install

00:06:03.711 --> 00:06:08.216
a locator on the ray
for just this situation.

00:06:08.299 --> 00:06:10.301
(clicking, whirring)

